                                                "sense_id": "cfc19232-ee75-303a-8f15-1b4f2b6057e0",
                                                "text": "\"Maybe he'll git the cops after you, Jack.\" \"I'll watch out fer dat, Nick, an' you must watch out too,\" answered Jack Sagger."
